{"code":0,"data":{"title":"icon文件上传","content":"<h2 id=\"s-rfypqhn3\">app.upload.icon</h2><p>功能描述：游戏更新icon文件上传</p><p><br></p><h2 id=\"s-likey2rs\">环境信息</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"175\" style=\"width: 175px\"><p><strong>环境</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"417\" style=\"width: 417px\"><p><strong>HTTPS地址</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"175\" style=\"width: 175px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>正式环境</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"417\" style=\"width: 417px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>https://developer-api.vivo.com.cn/router/rest</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><h2 id=\"s-cnncutcn\">公共参数</h2><p>调用任何一个API都必须传入的参数，目前支持的公共参数有：</p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\"><p><strong>参数名称</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"134\" style=\"width: 134px\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"129\" style=\"width: 129px\"><p><strong>是否必须</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"572\" style=\"width: 572px\"><p><strong>参数描述</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>method</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"134\" style=\"width: 134px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"129\" style=\"width: 129px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"572\" style=\"width: 572px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>接口名称：app.upload.icon</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>access_key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"134\" style=\"width: 134px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"129\" style=\"width: 129px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"572\" style=\"width: 572px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>申请API传包服务成功后vivo开放平台分配开发者接入的access_key。</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/326\">具体获取说明</a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>timestamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"134\" style=\"width: 134px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"129\" style=\"width: 129px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"572\" style=\"width: 572px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>时间戳（毫秒）示例：1567945333425，允许客户端请求最大时间误差为20分钟。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>format</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"134\" style=\"width: 134px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"129\" style=\"width: 129px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"572\" style=\"width: 572px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>响应格式。默认值：json。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>v</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"134\" style=\"width: 134px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"129\" style=\"width: 129px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"572\" style=\"width: 572px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>API协议版本，可选值：1.0。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>sign_method</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"134\" style=\"width: 134px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"129\" style=\"width: 129px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"572\" style=\"width: 572px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>签名的摘要算法，可选值为：hmac。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>sign</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"134\" style=\"width: 134px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"129\" style=\"width: 129px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"572\" style=\"width: 572px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>API输入参数签名结果，<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/327#w1-84225273\">签名算法参照下面的介绍</a>。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>target_app_key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"134\" style=\"width: 134px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"129\" style=\"width: 129px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"572\" style=\"width: 572px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>被调用的目标key，可选值：developer。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><h2 id=\"s-s297q1ib\">请求参数</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>请求方式</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"3\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189,130,719\" style=\"width: 1038px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>POST</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>参数名称</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189\" style=\"width: 189px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>类型</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>是否必填</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"719\" style=\"width: 719px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>字段说明</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>packageName</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189\" style=\"width: 189px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"719\" style=\"width: 719px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>游戏包名</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>file</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"189\" style=\"width: 189px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>multipart/form-data</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"130\" style=\"width: 130px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"719\" style=\"width: 719px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>上传的文件</p><p>支持jpg/png格式，尺寸要求长等于宽，不低于256*256，不超过512*512，大小500k以内，仅支持直角图标。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><h2 id=\"s-08dq68gf\">响应参数</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\"><p><strong>参数名称</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\"><p><strong>类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"128\" style=\"width: 128px\"><p><strong>是否返回</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"360\" style=\"width: 360px\"><p><strong>字段说明</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>code</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>int</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"128\" style=\"width: 128px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"360\" style=\"width: 360px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>返回码</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>msg</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"128\" style=\"width: 128px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"360\" style=\"width: 360px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>信息描述</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>subCode</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"128\" style=\"width: 128px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"360\" style=\"width: 360px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>请求子返回码</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>data</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Object</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"128\" style=\"width: 128px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"360\" style=\"width: 360px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>上传后的文件信息。上传失败时不返回此参数。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>packageName</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"128\" style=\"width: 128px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"360\" style=\"width: 360px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>包名</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>serialnumber</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"128\" style=\"width: 128px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"360\" style=\"width: 360px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>文件上传成功的后流水号</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><h2 id=\"s-6qlfzp4i\">响应示例</h2><pre><code>成功示例：\n{\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"code\":0,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"msg\":\"成功\"，\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"subCode\"&nbsp;:&nbsp;\"0\",\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"data\":&nbsp;{\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"packageName\":&nbsp;\"com.test.test\",\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"serialnumber\":&nbsp;\"210c5cbc67fdded24245eec7ff5d605c\"\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}\n&nbsp;}\n\n失败示例：\n{\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"code\":10001,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"msg\":\"签名校验失败\"\n}\n\n业务失败示例\n{\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"code\":0,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"subCode\":\"13001\",\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"msg\":\"上传的文件不存在，上传失败\"\n}</code></pre><p><br></p><h2 id=\"s-74slzivt\">业务返回码</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\"><p><strong>返回码</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"407\" style=\"width: 407px\"><p><strong>描述</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>12010</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"407\" style=\"width: 407px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>当前更新应用正在审核，不允许更新</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>12022</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"407\" style=\"width: 407px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>当前更新应用待上架，不允许更新</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>13001</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"407\" style=\"width: 407px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>上传的文件不存在，上传失败</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>13002</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"407\" style=\"width: 407px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>包名不属于当前开发者</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>13003</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"407\" style=\"width: 407px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>请检查文件是否正常，文件上传失败</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>13004</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"407\" style=\"width: 407px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>文件上传服务异常，请稍后再试</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>13005</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"407\" style=\"width: 407px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>icon图片类型错误，支持jpg，png</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>13006</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"407\" style=\"width: 407px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>icon文件大小不能超过500KB</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>13007</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"407\" style=\"width: 407px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>icon文件尺寸不低于256*256，不超过512*512</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>20008</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"407\" style=\"width: 407px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>必填参数不能为空</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p>","versionCode":6,"updateTime":1782291169000,"b